Fix macOS compilation error in loslib.c

- Guard Linux-specific headers <sys/prctl.h> and <linux/seccomp.h> with #if defined(__linux__).
- Add #include <pthread.h> for macOS support.
- Implement macOS-compatible os_tid using pthread_threadid_np.
- Implement macOS-compatible os_aname returning "Darwin".
- Explicitly disable os_seccomp and os_prctl on macOS (return "not supported").

